<h4><b>Add collaborators outside of U of T</b></h4>

<p><span style="font-size:14px;">Only users who are affiliated with U of T and have a UTORid can create a dataverse collection or dataset in U of T Dataverse. However, once you have created a dataverse collection or dataset, you can add external collaborators. The person you would like to add must first sign up for an account with Borealis. After the external collaborator has registered their external collaborator account, the dataverse collection or dataset administrator can add them as a collaborator.</span></p>

<h5><b>To register as an external collaborator:</b></h5>

<ol>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;">Go to <a href="https://borealisdata.ca/dataverse/dv">U of T Dataverse</a></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;">Click Log In in the top right corner of the navigation bar</span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;">Under Underneath Institution not listed? click Sign up</span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;">Register with your preferred email</span></li>
</ol>

